# Colony alert broadcast when Govfor starts or cancels an evacuation from the command tablet, during an Insurgency round to notify insurgents/colonists to start making their final moves.
govfor-evac-started = 殖民地通知：军事指挥部正在撤退，并已启动政府部队的撤离程序。他们将在 { $minutes } 分钟后离开。
govfor-evac-cancelled = 殖民地通知：军事指挥部已取消其撤离程序，政府部队不会离开，其行动将继续进行。